# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local development.
#
# The Deploy to Cloudflare flow reads this file to learn which secrets to ask
# for on its setup page, so the value is deliberately left empty: a default
# here would be a default in every one-click deployment.
#
# ADMIN_PASSWORD doubles as the JWT signing key. A guessable password is a
# guessable HMAC key — use a long random string, not a memorable one.
# In production, set it with `pnpm secret`.
ADMIN_PASSWORD=
